<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Oct broad money M3 up 22.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Oct broad money M3 up 22.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's broad money M3 expanded by 22.6 percent year-on-year in October against 21.2 percent growth in September, the central bank said.</p>
<p>In a statement released on Wednesday, Bank Negara Malaysia said that liquidity conditions remained ample and interest rates stayed stable in October.  </p>
<p>		   MALAYSIA MONETARY AGGREGATES:</p>
<p>(Percentage change at end of period, year-on-year)</p>
<p>	     Oct 96	Sept 96     Oct 95</p>
<p>  M1	  17.1	   19.4	  8.4</p>
<p>  M2	  22.3	   19.9	 20.4</p>
<p>  M3	  22.6	   21.2	 19.5</p>
<p>Note: M1 - money in circulation and cash on deposit in banks</p>
<p>	 M2 - M1 plus time, savings and foreign currency deposits</p>
<p>	 M3 - broad money</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
